// #69 claim-mutation fixture: `?(Foreach party: paid(party) When False)` is vacuously true
// because 0 instances match `When False`, so flipping `?` to `?!` ALSO passes unless caught
// by `charter test --mutate-claims`.
Fact party Identified by Alice.
Fact paid Identified by party.

Scenario vacuous-claim-survives {
  +paid(Alice).
  ?paid(Alice).
  ?occurred (paid(party) When False).
}
